        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Security Ownership of Certain Beneficial Owners and Management</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 24px 40px 40px 40px;\n    max-width: 1150px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .top-rule {\n    border-top: 4px solid #808080;\n    margin: 12px 0 28px 0;\n  }\n  .toc {\n    color: #0000CC;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    text-indent: 40px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style-type: disc;\n    margin: 8px 0 18px 0;\n    padding-left: 80px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li {\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n  }\n  table.owners {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  table.owners th {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 0 6px 1px 6px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n  table.owners th.name-col {\n    text-align: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  table.owners th.num-col {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  table.owners td {\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n  table.owners td.num {\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 30px;\n  }\n  table.owners td.pct {\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  table.owners td.pct-star {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-right: 30px;\n  }\n  tr.shade td {\n    background-color: #CCEBFB;\n  }\n  td.group-head {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .indent-sub {\n    padding-left: 22px !important;\n  }\n  .fn-rule {\n    width: 170px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #000;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  table.footnotes {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  table.footnotes td {\n    vertical-align: top;\n    padding: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  table.footnotes td.marker {\n    width: 46px;\n    padding-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"toc\">Table of Contents</div>\n\n<h1 class=\"doc-title\">SECURITY OWNERSHIP OF<br>\nCERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS AND MANAGEMENT</h1>\n\n<p class=\"body\">The following table sets forth information as of April 15, 2008 as to shares of our common stock beneficially owned by:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n  <li>each director;</li>\n  <li>each of the executive officers named in the Summary Compensation Table;</li>\n  <li>all of our directors and executive officers as a group; and</li>\n  <li>all those known by us to be beneficial owners of more than five percent or more of our common stock.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"body\">Beneficial ownership is determined in accordance with the SEC's rules and generally includes voting or investment power with respect to securities as well as shares of common stock subject to options exercisable within 60 days of April 15, 2008. Unless otherwise indicated, the address of each of the individuals listed below is c/o NVIDIA Corporation, 2701 San Tomas Expressway, Santa Clara, California 95050.</p>\n\n<table class=\"owners\">\n  <colgroup>\n    <col style=\"width:40%\">\n    <col style=\"width:17%\">\n    <col style=\"width:19%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:10%\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th class=\"name-col\">Name and Address of Beneficial Owner</th>\n      <th class=\"num-col\">Shares<br>Owned(#) (1)</th>\n      <th class=\"num-col\">Shares Issuable<br>Pursuant to<br>Options Exercisable<br><br>Within 60 days of<br>April 15, 2008(#)</th>\n      <th class=\"num-col\">Total of<br>Shares<br>Beneficially<br>Owned(#)</th>\n      <th class=\"num-col\">Percent<br>(%)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td class=\"group-head\">Named Executive Officers:</td>\n      <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Jen-Hsun Huang</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">22,123,704(2)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">6,570,744</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">28,694,448</td>\n      <td class=\"pct\">5.1%</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>Marvin D. Burkett</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">175,705</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">468,564</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">644,269</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ajay K. Puri</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">4,146</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">397,861</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">402,007</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>David M. Shannon</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">64,454(3)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">236,070</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">300,524</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Debora Shoquist</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">&mdash;</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">41,666</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">41,666</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td class=\"group-head\">Directors, not including CEO:</td>\n      <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Steven Chu, Ph.D.</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">&mdash;</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">281,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">281,250</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>Tench Coxe</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">1,399,644(4)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">716,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">2,115,894</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>James C. Gaither</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">159,405</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">311,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">470,655</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>Harvey C. Jones</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">2,004,743(5)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">446,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">2,450,993</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>William J. Miller</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">302,808(6)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">1,106,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">1,409,058</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>Mark L. Perry</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">50,000(7)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">190,000</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">240,000</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>A. Brooke Seawell</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">150,000(8)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">1,286,250</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">1,436,250</td>\n      <td class=\"pct-star\">*</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td class=\"group-head\">All directors and executive officers as a group</td>\n      <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td class=\"indent-sub\">(12 persons)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">26,434,609(9)</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">12,052,405</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">38,487,014</td>\n      <td class=\"pct\">6.8</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"5\" style=\"height:12px\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"group-head\">5% Stockholders</td>\n      <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"shade\">\n      <td>Barclays Global Investors, NA. and Affiliates</td>\n      <td class=\"num\">34,074,489(10)</td>\n      <td clas